Error [E1205]: `somelib@1.0.0` pin belongs in `[dependencies:rust]`
 Why: when `jet.toml` is present, Rust crate versions are declared in `[dependencies:rust]`, not inline in `extern rust`
 Fix: remove `@1.0.0` from `extern rust "somelib@1.0.0"`, and add `somelib = "<version>"` to `[dependencies:rust]` in `jet.toml`
